Fonts. Paths starting with fonts/ are relative to the skill directory
(skills/lit-typographic-motion/); paths starting with <motion cache>/fonts/ are written by
`npx @litfamily/litgravity runtime install motion` (pinned URL, sha256-verified, licence fetched with the
font). <motion cache> is $LITGRAVITY_MOTION_RUNTIME, or
${XDG_DATA_HOME:-~/.local/share}/litgravity/runtime/motion.

